{"body":{"text":["**input:** what a function or a component takes, a list of types, each named for pointing within."]},"id":"1M87MMGTJ5A8011","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000Z"]}
{"body":{"text":["**placeholder:** a hole of a type, held at an input and named for pointing within; it holds nothing."]},"id":"1M87MMGTJ5A8012","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000Z"]}
